Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:15.77,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:16.39,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:17.35,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:18.85,OP,,0,0,0,,终究{\3c&HE989DE&}是{\3c&HED39FC&}玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:20.31,OP,,0,0,0,,表现出{\3c&HE989DE&}一{\3c&HED39FC&}脸遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:21.90,OP,,0,0,0,,IDE{\3c&HE989DE&}NT{\3c&HED39FC&}ITY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:23.48,OP,,0,0,0,,全都没有{\3c&HE989DE&}啦{\3c&HED39FC&}（对对对）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.48,0:01:24.94,OP,,0,0,0,,假{\3c&HE989DE&}货真{\3c&HED39FC&}货
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:26.53,OP,,0,0,0,,都分{\3c&HE989DE&}不{\3c&HED39FC&}清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:28.07,OP,,0,0,0,,窟窿e{\3c&HE989DE&}y{\3c&HED39FC&}e eye
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:29.03,OP,,0,0,0,,快{\3c&HE989DE&}说拜{\3c&HED39FC&}拜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:32.45,OP,,0,0,0,,本能！烦恼{\3c&HE989DE&}的{\3c&HED39FC&}战斗就惨败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:35.62,OP,,0,0,0,,Watch out！夺取别{\3c&HE989DE&}人{\3c&HED39FC&}个性的家伙决不允许
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.75,OP,,0,0,0,,那就用不一般的{\3c&HE989DE&}方{\3c&HED39FC&}式来招待  AW！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:42.00,OP,,0,0,0,,Perfect！将百亿满{\3c&HE989DE&}分{\3c&HED39FC&}的KAWAII送给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.96,OP,,0,0,0,,成为别{\3c&HE989DE&}人{\3c&HED39FC&}的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:47.80,OP,,0,0,0,,想？还{\3c&HE989DE&}是{\3c&HED39FC&}不想？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:54.18,OP,,0,0,0,,分离四散{\3c&HE989DE&}的{\3c&HED39FC&}细胞们呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:55.64,OP,,0,0,0,,再度集合（R{\3c&HE989DE&}ea{\3c&HED39FC&}dy GO！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.14,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:01:58.60,OP,,0,0,0,,别混{\3c&HE989DE&}入{\3c&HED39FC&}其中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.19,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:01.69,OP,,0,0,0,,就这{\3c&HE989DE&}样{\3c&HED39FC&}伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:03.23,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:04.82,OP,,0,0,0,,超越{\3c&HE989DE&}条条{\3c&HED39FC&}框框
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:06.44,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.20,OP,,0,0,0,,任{\3c&HE989DE&}其飞{\3c&HED39FC&}翔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:09.65,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:11.24,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:14.33,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Brun  {\3c&HED39FC&}不要妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.83,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}奔跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:17.37,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-B{\3c&HE989DE&}ru{\3c&HED39FC&}n  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:20.50,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Brun  {\3c&HE989DE&}想{\3c&HED39FC&}一直在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:23.63,OP,,0,0,0,,抓紧时间 {\3c&HE989DE&}去{\3c&HED39FC&}你身边…
